      "description": "## Overview\n\nTo enable saved token payments, you must first capture and save a customer's card token. This is accomplished by completing a successful 3DS transaction using the Intention API. The customer will have the option to save their card during checkout, and upon successful payment, you'll receive a card token via webhook.\n\n## Implementation Steps\n\n### Step 1: Create an Intention\n\nCreate a payment intention using the Intention API with a **3DS Card Integration ID**.\n\n**Integration ID Types You Can Use:**\n\n- Normal 3DS\n    \n- Verification\n    \n- Auth\n    \n\n### Step 2: Render Paymob UI\n\nDirect the customer to complete payment using one of Paymob's UI options:\n\n**Option A: Unified Checkout (Redirect)**  \nRedirect the customer to Paymob's hosted checkout page:\n\nOption B: Pixel Component (Embedded)  \nRender Paymob's Pixel component for an embedded checkout experience within your website.\n\n### Step 3: Customer Saves Card\n\nDuring the checkout process, the customer:\n\n1. Enters their card details\n    \n2. **Checks the \"Save Card\" checkbox** (this can be pre-checked and hidden if requested)\n    \n3. Completes the payment\n    \n\n**Important:** The card token will **only** be generated if the customer selects the \"Save Card\" option.\n\n### Step 4: Receive the Card Token\n\nAfter successful payment, you'll receive **two separate POST requests** to the `notification_url` specified in your intention request (or configured in your integration settings):\n\n**First Callback - Transaction Details:**  \nStandard transaction processed callback containing all payment information.\n\n**Second Callback - Card Token:**\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"type\": \"TOKEN\",\n  \"obj\": {\n    \"id\": 12929738,\n    \"token\": \"fb9fb86d94ff328efcdfed9b9eef7ac398cb446200c149b96a8ccd43\",\n    \"masked_pan\": \"xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-2346\",\n    \"merchant_id\": 1058607,\n    \"card_subtype\": \"MasterCard\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-01-20T14:16:05.038717\",\n    \"email\": \"testa@hgmail.com\",\n    \"order_id\": \"454732315\",\n    \"user_added\": false,\n    \"next_payment_intention\": \"pi_test_7ddb74640dd4495f9607034d3dcbedd6\"\n  }\n}\n\n ```\n\n**Security:** Verify the HMAC signature for the card token callback. Refer to the [HMAC Card Token Callback guide](https://developers.paymob.com/egypt/manage-callback/hmac/token-object-hmac-calculation-copy) for details.\n\n### Step 5: Store the Token\n\nSave the `token` value securely in your database, associated with the customer record. This token will be used for all future CIT or MIT transactions."
