      "description": "Customer Initiated Transactions allow returning customers to complete payments quickly using their saved cards. The customer is present during the transaction and only needs to enter their CVV to authorize the payment. The full card details remain securely stored and are not re-entered.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- A saved card token from the [Create Card Token](#create-card-token) process\n    \n- The token stored in your database and associated with the customer\n    \n\n## Implementation Steps\n\n### Step 1: Create an Intention with Card Token\n\nCreate a payment intention using a **Card On File Integration ID**, including the saved card token.\n\n**Integration ID Types You Can Use:**\n\n- Normal 3DS\n    \n- Auth\n    \n- **Card On File** (Recommended for saved card payments)\n    \n\n> **📝 Note:** In **Test Mode**, please use the **Test 3DS (Normal Card) Integration ID**. In **Live Mode**, the **Card-on-File Integration ID** will be created and provided accordingly. \n  \n\n##   \n**Required Body Parameters:**\n\n  \nInclude the `card_tokens` array in your intention request along with standard parameters:\n\n``` json\n  \"card_tokens\": [\"eafacchsnf1a3784444g4284b54319fath#12445488e1833633f7tab\"],\n\n ```\n\n**Key Parameter:**\n\n- `card_tokens` - Array of saved card tokens (accepts up to 3 tokens)\n    \n\n**Important Response Parameter:**\n\n- `client_secret` - Required for Step 2\n    \n\n### Step 2: Redirect to Unified Checkout\n\nDirect the customer to the Unified Checkout page:\n\n```\nhttps://accept.paymob.com/unifiedcheckout/?publicKey={{public_key}}&clientSecret={{client_secret}}\n\n ```\n\n**Obtaining Your Keys:**\n\n- `public_key` - Available in your Paymob Dashboard ([Access Public Key guide](https://docs.paymob.com))\n    \n- `client_secret` - Returned in the intention response from Step 1\n    \n\n### Step 3: Customer Completes Payment\n\nThe customer will see their saved card on the checkout page and only needs to:\n\n1. Select the saved card (if multiple cards are available)\n    \n2. Enter the CVV number\n    \n3. Click to complete payment\n    \n\n<img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/d748ad47-6dff-45bd-bef6-e328898e9c37/aW1hZ2UucG5n\" width=\"545\" height=\"253\">\n\nStep 4: Receive Callbacks\n\nUpon successful payment, you'll receive transaction callbacks at your configured `notification_url`.\n\n**Security:** Verify HMAC signatures on all callbacks. Refer to the [Webhook/Callback HMAC documentation](https://developers.paymob.com/egypt/manage-callback/transaction-callbacks)."
